<view class="page"><view class="title">商品管理</view><view class="subtitle">价格、可售库存与上下架</view><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo">修改仅作用于此设备的试用数据，原商品表不会改变。</view>
 <block wx:if="{{!selected}}"><input class="search" placeholder="搜索商品、IP或商品编号" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="chips"><view class="chip {{filter==='all'?'active':''}}" data-value="all" bindtap="filter">全部</view><view class="chip {{filter==='active'?'active':''}}" data-value="active" bindtap="filter">在售</view><view class="chip {{filter==='inactive'?'active':''}}" data-value="inactive" bindtap="filter">已下架</view></view><view class="muted">共 {{resultCount}} 件商品</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="reload">重试</button></view><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="card row space-top" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><image class="thumb" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="grow"><view class="two-lines">{{item.name}}</view><view class="row space-top"><view><text class="price">活动价 ¥{{item.priceText}}</text><view class="muted">原零售价 ¥{{item.originalPriceText}}</view></view><text class="muted">库存 {{item.stock}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="tag">{{item.active?'在售':'已下架'}}</text><text class="link">修改 ›</text></view></view></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="secondary" bindtap="more">查看更多</button><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载商品…</view></block>
 <block wx:else><view class="card space-top"><view class="row"><image class="thumb" src="{{selected.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="grow"><view>{{selected.name}}</view><view class="muted">编号 {{selected.id}}</view></view></view><view class="label">款式</view><picker disabled="{{busy}}" range="{{selected.skus}}" range-key="name" value="{{skuIndex}}" bindchange="sku"><view class="field region-field">{{selected.skus[skuIndex].name}}<text>⌄</text></view></picker><view class="label">原零售价（元 / 原表售卖单位）</view><input disabled="{{busy}}" class="field" type="digit" value="{{price}}" data-field="price" bindinput="field"/><view class="label">调整可售库存 · 当前 {{selected.skus[skuIndex].stock}}</view><input disabled="{{busy}}" class="field" type="text" value="{{stockDelta}}" data-field="stockDelta" bindinput="field"/><view class="note">补货填正数，减库存填负数，不调整填0。全场五折按此原价计算。已下单占用的库存不计入此处；取消订单会自动返还。</view><view class="row line"><text>商品上架</text><switch disabled="{{busy}}" checked="{{active}}" color="#ec7489" bindchange="active"/></view><view wx:if="{{selected.needsReview}}" class="demo">此商品售卖资料仍待核对，本页保存不会解除正式交易限制。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存修改</button><button class="secondary space-top" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}">返回商品列表</button></block>
</view>
